        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700140/extras/bed184e4ad098c107b2474647f23c977.avif?t=1757702037\" width=900 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a final bid to cheat death, you challenge The Alleyman to a high-stakes dice game where every roll could be your last. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though the game is simple... what The Alleyman offers isn’t: more time. Beat him, and attain extra life—lose, and he takes what time you have left. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you? You’re dying anyway, frail body ravaged by an incurable disease. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single die. A single choice: Will you take the deal?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700140/extras/f9ee6a4bde85a56d48ad608b07907ca3.avif?t=1757702037\" width=900 height=47 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⌛ GAME FEATURES ⌛</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>PIG: The Game</i> was made for the O2A2 VN Jam 2025, a micro Visual Novel Jam with strict asset limitations and a 1000 word limit.  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 core conclusions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 1,000 words.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original illustrations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Alleyman plays against you.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PIG contains mature themes and is intended for an older audience. Player discretion is advised for visual and written descriptions of gambling, death, and disease.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700140/extras/bed184e4ad098c107b2474647f23c977.avif?t=1757702037\" width=900 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a final bid to cheat death, you challenge The Alleyman to a high-stakes dice game where every roll could be your last. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though the game is simple... what The Alleyman offers isn’t: more time. Beat him, and attain extra life—lose, and he takes what time you have left. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you? You’re dying anyway, frail body ravaged by an incurable disease. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single die. A single choice: Will you take the deal?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700140/extras/f9ee6a4bde85a56d48ad608b07907ca3.avif?t=1757702037\" width=900 height=47 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⌛ GAME FEATURES ⌛</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>PIG: The Game</i> was made for the O2A2 VN Jam 2025, a micro Visual Novel Jam with strict asset limitations and a 1000 word limit.  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 core conclusions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 1,000 words.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original illustrations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Alleyman plays against you.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PIG contains mature themes and is intended for an older audience. Player discretion is advised for visual and written descriptions of gambling, death, and disease.</p>",
